WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.320
"I am very ill," the witch moaned.

2
00:00:09.321 --> 00:00:11.298
Rapunzel scowled.

3
00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:14.536
"You are sick from using too much magic!"

4
00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:18.435
The witch tried to sit up.

5
00:00:18.436 --> 00:00:23.515
"That rotten prince ruined everything!"

6
00:00:23.516 --> 00:00:28.663
"No," Rapunzel said. " You ruined

7
00:00:28.664 --> 00:00:32.306
everything. You hurt the prince with your awful

8
00:00:32.307 --> 00:00:35.852
spell. And you stole me from my

9
00:00:35.853 --> 00:00:41.387
family." The witch looked away. "I had a

10
00:00:41.388 --> 00:00:45.790
daughter. But she died when she was

11
00:00:45.791 --> 00:00:50.069
ten. I was sad and

12
00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:55.556
lonely. I wanted a family

13
00:00:55.557 --> 00:00:59.164
again." The witch

14
00:00:59.165 --> 00:01:03.523
sniffed. "I thought you could be my

15
00:01:03.524 --> 00:01:09.033
daughter. I was going to keep you with me

16
00:01:09.034 --> 00:01:17.358
forever. But then that prince found

17
00:01:17.359 --> 00:01:20.069
you!" The witch lay back

18
00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:27.014
down. "Please, Rapunzel, help me," she

19
00:01:27.015 --> 00:01:32.870
begged. Rapunzel thought for a

20
00:01:32.871 --> 00:01:37.627
moment. "I will heal you," she

21
00:01:37.628 --> 00:01:41.555
said. "But you must make me a

22
00:01:41.556 --> 00:01:45.739
promise." "What?" the witch

23
00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:50.178
croaked. "You must let me go home," Rapunzel said.

24
00:01:50.179 --> 00:01:55.945
The witch was silent.

25
00:01:55.946 --> 00:02:02.234
Rapunzel spun around. "Good-bye!"

26
00:02:02.235 --> 00:02:10.135
"Fine," the witch said. "You may go home!"

27
00:02:10.136 --> 00:02:16.978
"Good." Rapunzel came back.

28
00:02:16.979 --> 00:02:20.616
She took out her healing potions.

29
00:02:20.617 --> 00:02:27.865
She dripped drops into the witch's mouth.

30
00:02:27.866 --> 00:02:37.651
She rubbed lotion onto the witch's skin.

31
00:02:37.652 --> 00:02:41.406
Slowly the witch sat up.

32
00:02:41.407 --> 00:02:45.471
"You are free now, so go home."

33
00:02:45.472 --> 00:02:53.235
Rapunzel quickly spun away from the witch.

34
00:02:53.236 --> 00:02:58.214
She never wanted to see the evil woman again!

35
00:02:58.215 --> 00:03:01.667
Rapunzel ran off into the forest.

36
00:03:01.668 --> 00:03:08.511
She heard the witch laugh loudly.

37
00:03:08.512 --> 00:03:11.814
"Good luck finding the prince . . .

38
00:03:11.815 --> 00:03:18.402
If he's still alive!"

39
00:03:18.403 --> 00:03:24.215
Rapunzel gasped. "I must hurry!"

40
00:03:24.216 --> 00:03:28.595
She called for the prince.

41
00:03:28.596 --> 00:03:31.389
But no one answered.

42
00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:36.512
She searched the woods for hours.

43
00:03:36.513 --> 00:03:39.661
The prince was nowhere to be found.

44
00:03:39.662 --> 00:03:43.897
Rapunzel's legs and feet ached.

45
00:03:43.898 --> 00:03:46.569
She wanted to keep searching.

46
00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:57.682
But she was too tired to move further.

